{"id":"4426348","name":"Jayden Daniels","team":"WSH","pos":"QB","grp":"QB","num":"5","head":"https://a.espncdn.com/i/headshots/nfl/players/full/4426348.png","age":25,"exp":"3","college":"LSU; Arizona State","draft":["2024","1","2"],"depth":{"pos":"QB","rank":1,"unit":"3WR 1TE","team":"WSH"},"inj":{"status":"Active","note":"Daniels' final numbers won't displease fantasy managers by any stretch, but the athletic signal-caller didn't really get the Commanders offense going until the second half. He put Washington's first touchdown of the night on the board in the waning seconds of the third quarter when he connected with Stefon Diggs from one yard out, and he followed it up with a 10-play, 90-yard march early in the fourth quarter that he capped off with a nine-yard touchdown toss to Rachaad White. However, Daniels and the Commanders came up empty on a subsequent 13-play drive that ended on downs, and the 2024 first-round pick then took a sack on the game's final play after triggering a 10-second runoff with an intentional grounding penalty on the prior snap. Despite the disappointing outcome, Daniels has been solid in his first two games back from an elbow injury, and he'll next face off with the Eagles at home on Sunday night, Nov. 1, following a Week 7 bye.","date":"2026-10-20T04:00Z","detail":""},"next":null,"dvp":null,"news":[{"h":"Commanders' Quinn, Daniels discuss QB's throwaway on fourth-down play","d":"Commanders quarterback Jayden Daniels shouldn't have thrown a fourth-down pass away in the second quarter of Monday night's loss, coach Dan Quinn said.","t":"2026-10-20T21:45:09Z"},{"h":"Jayden Daniels addresses teammates on gaffe, vows 'it'll never happen again'","d":"Jayden Daniels addressed his Commanders teammates, once more blaming himself for the end-of-overtime debacle against the Giants and vowing it won't happen again.","t":"2026-10-16T13:50:51Z"},{"h":"Micah Parsons: 'Jayden Daniels probably cost my man Dan Quinn his job'","d":"Micah Parsons said on hi